==English==

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# [[capable]] or [[deserving]] to be [[admitted]], [[accepted]] or [[allowed]]; [[allowable]], [[permissible]], [[acceptable]]
# {{artificial intelligence}} Describing a [[heuristic]] that never [[overestimate]]s the [[cost]] of reaching a [[goal]].

